# Rainmaker scaffolds these into whatever directory it runs in. None of it is
# part of the published site, and two of them must not be committed to a public
# repository: the config carries the real site, ICP, conversion paths and any
# Search Console property, and data/ carries real traffic, conversion counts and
# modelled pipeline. Matched by shape rather than by product name, because
# renaming the product would otherwise silently unprotect them.
*.config.yml
data/
context/
skills/_shared/
.agents/skills/
.claude/skills/
RAINMAKER.md
